Package: webreadr
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Reading Formatted Access Log Files
Version: 0.4.0
Date: 2016-01-23
Author: Oliver Keyes
Maintainer: Oliver Keyes <ironholds@gmail.com>
Description: R is used by a vast array of people for a vast array of
        purposes - including web analytics. This package contains
        functions for consuming and munging various common forms of
        request log, including the Common and Combined Web Log formats
        and various Amazon access logs.
